[
  {
    "index": 0,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": "Welcome to the town of Postwick\\c\\nA farming town since days of old, where people\\nand their Pok\u00E9mon live in close harmony."
  },
  {
    "index": 1,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": "[~ 1]"
  },
  {
    "index": 2,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": "Route 1"
  },
  {
    "index": 3,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": "Welcome to the town of Wedgehurst\\c\\nOur quiet borough is home to the esteemed\\nPok\u00E9mon Research Lab."
  },
  {
    "index": 4,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": "Route 2"
  },
  {
    "index": 5,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": "Trainer Tips\\c\\nPok\u00E9mon can gain Exp. Points by battling other\\nPok\u00E9mon. Exp. Points help them grow stronger.\\c\\nAnd your Pok\u00E9mon will still get Exp. Points even\\nif you catch a Pok\u00E9mon you are battling against!"
  },
  {
    "index": 6,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": "Trainer Tips\\c\\nTrying to take another person\u2019s Pok\u00E9mon makes\\nyou no different than a thief!\\c\\nPok\u00E9 Balls are only to be used to try to catch\\nwild Pok\u00E9mon that have no Trainers!"
  },
  {
    "index": 7,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": "The Pok\u00E9mon Nursery\\c\\nYou\u2019ve found the right place to come to for all\\nyour Pok\u00E9mon Egg finding needs."
  },
  {
    "index": 8,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": "Welcome to the city of Motostoke\\c\\nAn industrial city studded with steam-powered\\nmarvels of modern engineering."
  },
  {
    "index": 9,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": "Route 3"
  },
  {
    "index": 10,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": "Trainer Tips\\c\\nYou can set up camp on routes, and your\\nPok\u00E9mon can earn Exp. Points from camping.\\c\\nTry visiting other people\u2019s camps, too, when you\\nfind tents along your way."
  },
  {
    "index": 11,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": "[~ 11]"
  },
  {
    "index": 12,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": "Galar Mine lies ahead"
  },
  {
    "index": 13,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": "Route 4"
  },
  {
    "index": 14,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": "Trainer Tips\\c\\nA Pok\u00E9mon\u2019s moves can be physical moves or\\nspecial moves.\\c\\nA high Attack stat makes physical moves deal\\nmore damage, and a high Sp. Atk stat makes\\r\\nspecial moves deal more damage!"
  },
  {
    "index": 15,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": "Welcome to the town of Turffield\\c\\nA town nestled within the nurturing bowl of our\\nmany terraced farming fields."
  },
  {
    "index": 16,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": "Welcome to the town of Turffield\\c\\nRenowned since days of yore for the stunning\\nand historical geoglyph upon our hill!"
  },
  {
    "index": 17,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": "Turffield Stadium"
  },
  {
    "index": 18,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": "Route 5"
  },
  {
    "index": 19,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": "The Pok\u00E9mon Nursery\\c\\nYou\u2019ve found the right place to come to for all\\nyour Pok\u00E9mon Egg finding needs."
  },
  {
    "index": 20,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": "[~ 20]"
  },
  {
    "index": 21,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": "Trainer Tips\\c\\nPok\u00E9mon that appear to be surrounded by a\\nbrilliant aura tend to be stronger than others.\\r\\nAnd when you defeat them, they drop Watts!\\c\\nIt seems you become more likely to spot these\\nBrilliant Pok\u00E9mon the more Pok\u00E9mon you catch!"
  },
  {
    "index": 22,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": "Welcome to the town of Hulbury\\c\\nA bustling seaport that many visit to see its\\nlively market stalls and famed restaurant!"
  },
  {
    "index": 23,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": "Hulbury Stadium"
  },
  {
    "index": 24,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": "Motostoke Outskirts"
  },
  {
    "index": 25,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": "Galar Mine No. 2 \u2192\\n\u2190 Motostoke"
  },
  {
    "index": 26,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": "Welcome to the ancient city of Hammerlocke\\c\\nA city of great history, living and thriving within\\ncastle walls that date back to the middle ages."
  },
  {
    "index": 27,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": "Route 6"
  },
  {
    "index": 28,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": "Trainer Tips\\c\\nYou can use each Technical Machine, or TM, as\\nmany times as you like on your Pok\u00E9mon.\\c\\nTeach your Pok\u00E9mon moves of various types to\\ngive them an advantage against all kinds of\\r\\ndifferent opponents in battle!\\c\\nTechnical Records, or TRs, can only be used one\\ntime before they break, however.\\r\\nBe more thoughtful when choosing to use them!"
  },
  {
    "index": 29,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": "Welcome to the town of Stow-on-Side\\c\\nA vibrant town that has grown up around an\\nancient mural tucked away in the mountains."
  },
  {
    "index": 30,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": "\u2191 Ballonlea\\n\u2193 Stow-on-Side"
  },
  {
    "index": 31,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": "Come see the famed sights of Stow-on-Side!\\nDiscover the history of the Galar region!"
  },
  {
    "index": 32,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": "[~ 32]"
  },
  {
    "index": 33,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": "Stow-on-Side Stadium"
  },
  {
    "index": 34,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": "Welcome to the town of Ballonlea\\c\\nA charming town where the people make their\\nhomes among the trunks of the towering trees."
  },
  {
    "index": 35,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": "Ballonlea Stadium"
  },
  {
    "index": 36,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": "Route 7"
  },
  {
    "index": 37,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": "Trainer Tips\\c\\nIf you want to stop a Pok\u00E9mon from evolving,\\npress the B Button while it\u2019s trying to evolve.\\r\\nThe Pok\u00E9mon will be startled and stop evolving.\\c\\nThis trick is called an Evolution cancel!"
  },
  {
    "index": 38,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": "Welcome to the town of Circhester\\c\\nBuildings from an age long gone still stand about\\nthe steaming hot spring that covers the town."
  },
  {
    "index": 39,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": "Trainer Tips\\c\\nThe Pok\u00E9mon species you see recommended in\\nyour Pok\u00E9dex will be updated once you manage\\r\\nto catch them all or when the date changes."
  },
  {
    "index": 40,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": "Circhester Stadium"
  },
  {
    "index": 41,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": "Route 8"
  },
  {
    "index": 42,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": "Trainer Tips\\c\\nChecking out glowing Pok\u00E9mon Dens in the\\nWild Area will help you store up Watts!\\c\\nIf you climbed all the way up here, you\u2019re likely\\nthe sort to investigate every nook and cranny.\\r\\nSo keep that curiosity alive to search out every\\r\\nlast den as you run around the Wild Area, too!"
  },
  {
    "index": 43,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": "Welcome to the town of Spikemuth\\c\\nThis rocking town has a punk vibe and streets\\ncrammed with shops lined up cheek by jowl."
  },
  {
    "index": 44,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": "Route 9"
  },
  {
    "index": 45,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": "\u2191 Route 9\\n\u2192 Spikemuth"
  },
  {
    "index": 46,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": "Circhester Bay"
  },
  {
    "index": 47,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": "\u2193 Spikemuth"
  },
  {
    "index": 48,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": "Trainer Tips\\c\\nThere are times when you throw a Pok\u00E9 Ball\\nto catch a Pok\u00E9mon, and it shakes just once.\\c\\nThe more Pok\u00E9mon you catch, the more likely\\nthis curious phenomenon is to occur.\\c\\nSince it makes it more likely you\u2019ll be able to\\ncatch your target, it\u2019s called a critical catch."
  },
  {
    "index": 49,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": "Route 10"
  },
  {
    "index": 50,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": "Trainer Tips\\c\\nThe Dynamax phenomenon is caused by a special\\npower that originates from within Pok\u00E9mon,\\r\\nwarping the space around them and making them\\r\\nappear far larger than they truly are.\\c\\nSome Pok\u00E9mon also change appearance upon\\nDynamaxing. This particular kind of Dynamaxing\\r\\nis also known as Gigantamaxing."
  },
  {
    "index": 51,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": "Welcome to the modern city of Wyndon\\c\\nThis booming metropolis was designed and\\ndeveloped by our very own Chairman Rose."
  },
  {
    "index": 52,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": "Flying lost in Wyndon\u2019s winding streets? Use the\\ncity\u2019s dedicated Flying Taxis or the monorail!"
  },
  {
    "index": 53,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": "Wyndon Stadium"
  },
  {
    "index": 54,
    "flags": 0,
    "text": "The Pok\u00E9mon Nursery\\c\\nYou\u2019ve found the right place to come to for all\\nyour Pok\u00E9mon Egg finding needs."
  },
  {
